  "text": "These three Claude Code plugins can stop Claude from wasting tokens. First up, Caveman. This forces Claude to respond with crisp, to-the-point answers. Just type this prompt in the Claude Code terminal and give it a task. It'll respond with four bullets instead of 400-word literature, sparing you the spend. That saved budget goes straight into the next plugin, Morph. Morph sits inside Claude Code and speeds up the mechanical work. See, normally Claude reasons through all of that, and reasoning is expensive. But with-",
